      en: ["The headwater region is situated at an altitude of nearly 3,000 meters above sea level.", "The wadi has a total length of approximately 150 to 170 kilometers.", "A modern dam in Wadi Siham was completed in 2005 for flash flood control.", "The wadi's catchment area covers more than 2,500 square kilometers.", "In the Tihama coastal plain, the wadi forms a wide alluvial delta.", "The river only reaches the Red Sea during exceptionally heavy rainfall events."],
      es: ["Longitud: 150 km", "Cuenca hidrográfica: 3.500 km²", "Altitud máxima en el extremo superior: 2.500 m", "Altitud mínima en la desembocadura: 0 m", "Sedimentación anual: aprox. 2 cm de lodo por año", "Población en la cuenca: aprox. 200.000"],
